:name: HawkHealth (STM32F767)
:description: Run the HawkHealth system in Renode and watch its telemetry on USART3.
#
# EDIT the two absolute paths below for YOUR machine (forward slashes, no quotes):
#   1) the platform file in your clone:  <clone>/platforms/hawkhealth_f767.repl
#   2) the firmware you downloaded from Actions -> hawkhealth-firmware -> hawkhealth.elf
#
using sysbus
mach create "hawkhealth"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @C:/Users/bronat/CENG4200/hawkhealth/platforms/hawkhealth_f767.repl
sysbus LoadELF @C:/Users/bronat/Downloads/hawkhealth-firmware/hawkhealth.elf
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart3
#
# then, at the (hawkhealth) monitor prompt:  start
